# A held callable's formal given by place and again by name is refused as it
# is for a method.
fn: make2 (int: n) fn: (int: x; int: y) int
    fn: f2 (int: x; int: y) int
        return: n + x * 10 + y
    return: f2
h2: make2 100
int: r h2(1 x: 2)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
